    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7EvLRB",
      "title": "Add GNET by Galactica.com",
      "author": "mike-tis",
      "number": 1281,
      "body": "**Summary**\r\nThis PR is to add the Galactica Network Token (GNET) to the Superchain token list for Base. GNET is an ERC-20 token powering the Identity Virtual Machine (IVM), the first omni-chain identity stack that enables Web3 identity primitives through zkCertificates, reputation systems, and privacy-preserving data verification.\r\n\r\n- name: GNET\r\n- symbol: GNET\r\n- decimals: 18\r\n- website: https://galactica.com/\r\n- twitter: @GalacticaNet\r\n- Etherscan: https://etherscan.io/address/0x690F1eEf8AcEaD09Ac695d9111Af081045c6d5b7\r\n- Basescan: https://basescan.org/address/0x2e78370349efe013db5758740f532d529d2688a0",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
